        "PASS"
      ],
      "conclusion": "REJECTED",
      "classifications": [
        "CONFIRMED BEHAVIOR"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "H07-04",
      "statement": "three operator vocabularies drift (models.Operator enum, canonical engine, ControlRegistry): the spec's 'in' operator is unimplemented, the registry falls through to equality for greater/less_than_or_equal (wrong verdicts for the juniper controls that use them), and unknown operators silently evaluate as equals",
      "evidence_tests": [
        "V07-07",
        "V07-08",
        "V07-33",
        "V07-34"
      ],
      "observed_statuses": [
        "PASS",
        "PASS",
        "PASS",
        "PASS"
      ],
      "conclusion": "REJECTED",
      "classifications": [
        "CONFIRMED BEHAVIOR"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "H07-05",
      "statement": "control structure defects make six controls permanently REVIEW (target.model_path values that are not Universal Security Model leaves) and let a duplicate control_id silently overwrite another vendor's control in the registry",
